---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — DekhoYahan"
  description="How DekhoYahan handles your information."
>
  <section class="content-page shell">
    <p class="section-kicker">Privacy</p>

    <h1>
      Privacy, explained
      <em>simply.</em>
    </h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        You can read DekhoYahan without creating an account or giving us personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>If you join DekhoYahan</h2>

      <p>
        If you choose to join, we currently ask only for your email address.
      </p>

      <p>
        We use it so we can contact you about new DekhoYahan explanations,
        important updates, and occasional opportunities to help shape what we explain next.
      </p>

      <p>
        We do not ask for your name, company, job title, location, or other profile information
        as part of joining.
      </p>

      <h2>How we store it</h2>

      <p>
        DekhoYahan currently uses Cloudflare infrastructure to run and protect the website.
        Email addresses submitted through the Join form are stored in our Cloudflare database.
      </p>

      <p>
        Like most websites, Cloudflare may process normal technical information needed to
        deliver and protect the site, such as IP addresses, request information, browser details,
        and security signals.
      </p>

      <h2>What we do not do</h2>

      <p>
        We do not sell your personal information.
      </p>

      <p>
        We are not currently using advertising cookies or building advertising profiles from your activity.
      </p>

      <h2>If you want to leave</h2>

      <p>
        You can ask us to stop contacting you or remove your information by emailing
        <a href="mailto:hello@dekhoyahan.com">hello@dekhoyahan.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>If things change</h2>

      <p>
        DekhoYahan will grow over time. If we later add analytics, accounts,
        community features, or other services that change how information is handled,
        we will update this page and explain the change clearly.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>

      <p>
        Email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@dekhoyahan.com">hello@dekhoyahan.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Last updated:</strong> 14 August 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>